 # Exact IIR seek checkpoints
 
-Full identity: `R321.exact-iir-seek-checkpoints.report-continuity`. Reused R-numbers are separate mechanisms.
+Full identity: `R321.exact-iir-seek-checkpoints.report-continuity`.
 
